          },
          "705430102": {
            "id": "705430102",
            "speakerId": 30526,
            "speakerName": "「团团灰」",
            "text": "…喵。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705430103"
            ]
          },
          "705430103": {
            "id": "705430103",
            "speakerId": 1011,
            "speakerName": "雷泽",
            "text": "…是你们。我在，聊天。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705430104"
            ]
          },
          "705430104": {
            "id": "705430104",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "聊天…雷泽是在和「团团灰」聊天吗？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705430105"
            ]
          },
          "705430105": {
            "id": "705430105",
            "speakerId": 30526,
            "speakerName": "「团团灰」",
            "text": "喵，喵喵。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705430106"
            ]
          },
          "705430106": {
            "id": "705430106",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "「团团灰」的意思好像是…「没错」？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705430107"
            ]
          },
          "705430107": {
            "id": "705430107",
            "speakerId": 1011,
            "speakerName": "雷泽",
            "text": "闻到熟悉的味道，找朋友。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705430108"
            ]
          },
          "705430108": {
            "id": "705430108",
            "speakerId": 1011,
            "speakerName": "雷泽",
            "text": "它很好，高兴。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705430109"
            ]
          },
          "705430109": {
            "id": "705430109",
            "speakerId": 30526,
            "speakerName": "「团团灰」",
            "text": "喵，喵。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705430110"
            ]
          },
          "705430110": {
            "id": "705430110",
            "speakerId": 1011,
            "speakerName": "雷泽",
            "text": "气味吸引朋友，你也来了，高兴。你身上，风和雨的味道，很熟悉…猫的气味，也熟悉。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705430111"
            ]
          },
          "705430111": {
            "id": "705430111",
            "speakerId": 1011,
            "speakerName": "雷泽",
            "text": "派蒙，甜甜的味道，好闻。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705430112"
            ]
          },
          "705430112": {
            "id": "705430112",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "欸？！甜甜的…难道是瓦乐瑞娜给我们的松饼的味道？我、我有吃那么多吗？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705430115"
            ]
          },
          "705430115": {
            "id": "705430115",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "完全没注意…哎呀，都怪松饼太好吃了嘛。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705430116"
            ]
          },
          "705430116": {
            "id": "705430116",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "嘿嘿，我还想吃甜甜花酿鸡、烤肉排和土豆饼…还有苹果酿！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705430117"
            ]
          },
          "705430117": {
            "id": "705430117",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "#那菜单就这么定啦，{NICKNAME}，我们快去找瓦乐瑞娜下单吧，雷泽也一起来嘛！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705430118"
            ]
          },
          "705430118": {
            "id": "705430118",
            "speakerId": 1011,
            "speakerName": "雷泽",
            "text": "谢…谢谢…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705430119"
            ]
          },
          "705430119": {
            "id": "705430119",
            "speakerId": 1011,
            "speakerName": "雷泽",
            "text": "「团团灰」给我带来了很多…坚果…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705430120"
            ]
          },
          "705430120": {
            "id": "705430120",
            "speakerId": 1011,
            "speakerName": "雷泽",
            "text": "还有，盒子的肉…我， 吃得很饱了。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705430121"
            ]
          },
          "705430121": {
            "id": "705430121",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "听起来好像是瓦乐瑞娜小姐点的外送订单？难道「团团灰」把外送餐品拿给了雷泽吃？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705430122"
            ]
          },
          "705430122": {
            "id": "705430122",
            "speakerId": 30526,
            "speakerName": "「团团灰」",
            "text": "喵喵。喵！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705430123"
            ]
          },
          "705430123": {
            "id": "705430123",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "没想到，「猫茸茸城堡」里还会有猫猫反过来招待客人的事呢！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705430124"
            ]
          },
          "705430124": {
            "id": "705430124",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "看来雷泽真的「猫缘」很棒！"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ]
